    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9641" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compluscŭli</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conp-</span></b> ), ae, a, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj. dim.</i>
			[complures], <i>a good many</i>, <i>not a
				few</i>, <i>several</i> (ante- and post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 1, 2, 43</span></i>
